        "original_id": "ae6d4e25-60d2-5ffd-9e84-5f78a655f195",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michèle Mercier, Charles Bronson\n- Roles: actresses, actors\n- Topics: leading men, film co-stars\n\nFacts:\n- Charles Bronson was born as Charles Dennis Buchinsky, with the Lithuanian form Karolis Dionyzas Bučinskis, on November 3, 1921.\n- Michèle Mercier was born as Jocelyne Yvonne Renée Mercier on January 1, 1939, and she is a French actress.\n- Charles Bronson was an American actor who died on August 30, 2003.\n- Michèle Mercier's leading men included Marcello Mastroianni, Vittorio Gassman, Jean-Paul Belmondo, Jean Gabin, Charles Aznavour, Robert Hossein, Charles Bronson, Tony Curtis, and Charlton Heston.",
